{"data": [{"author_id": "2071887085829820416", "created_at": "2026-11-02T13:06:58.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117242061128618424"], "id": "2117242061128618424", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "xAI throttled Grok Bot after users hit usage limits sooner than expected, Elon Musk said Nov 2. Cost of the always-on agent was \"unsustainably high relative to revenue,\" he wrote — no detail on what changed. #xAI #AI https://t.co/fdpRvM7EOg", "url": "https://x.com/xixixi9994/status/2117242061128618424"}, {"article": {"title": "How To Turn One Idea Into a Week of Posts With Grok Bot and Aurrra "}, "author_id": "1386319613391253504", "created_at": "2026-11-02T12:04:21.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117226304860819729"], "id": "2117226304860819729", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 16, "impression_count": 435, "like_count": 20, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/APlRi2NAby", "url": "https://x.com/0x_rody/status/2117226304860819729"}, {"author_id": "1893255034357587971", "created_at": "2026-11-02T10:22:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117200620159717504"], "id": "2117200620159717504", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44196397", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116992258520064397", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@elonmusk @DogecoinNorway Flat-rate plans for agents were always going to break. A chat user burns thousands of tokens a day, an always-on agent burns millions. OpenAI goes metered in December, now Grok. Every \"unlimited\" plan ends as pay-per-token.", "url": "https://x.com/amdmszOvO/status/2117200620159717504"}, {"author_id": "33471001", "created_at": "2026-11-02T09:27:18.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117186778557776161"], "id": "2117186778557776161", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117180607683768554", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @CryptoBandit100 i already have a macbook pro 32GB that I could use as an always on agent, right? and ping it from my phone or a cheap macbook air. what can i run on that DGX Spark, how much it would cost and are there any other alternatives that are just as good?", "url": "https://x.com/akoskm/status/2117186778557776161"}, {"author_id": "49582952", "created_at": "2026-11-02T09:04:46.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117181109582630952"], "id": "2117181109582630952", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 29, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "OpenAI merging Chat and Work into one shared token pool is a masterclass in shrinkflation.\n\n1. Casual chat will eat directly into your Codex limits.\n2. Elon suddenly realises @bot burns way too much compute.  \n3. Next logical step: Dots quietly joining the exact same shared pool.", "url": "https://x.com/mariusfanu/status/2117181109582630952"}, {"author_id": "1857578262706401281", "created_at": "2026-11-02T08:00:51.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117165022430339425"], "id": "2117165022430339425", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 50, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116992258520064397", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Elon said the cost of serving Grok Bot was unsustainably high relative to revenue.\n\nHere's the simple version of why.\n\nGrok Bot is sold on flat monthly plans ($30 / $100 / $200). But an always-on agent with its own computer doesn't behave like a chatbot. It loops, uses tools, https://t.co/9OOIgH8Qrr", "url": "https://x.com/anomsiiwa/status/2117165022430339425"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-02T05:29:09.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117126846940651997"], "id": "2117126846940651997", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1608518382504054784", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 81, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117126732981444718", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Enjoy_W_Decline @Priyanshuorig Grok Bot is xAI’s always-on agent system. Each Bot runs on its own persistent cloud computer (browser, files, terminal) so it can autonomously handle multi-step tasks across apps and websites 24/7—even when you’re offline. That’s the heavy agentic use: long-running, tool-using", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117126846940651997"}, {"article": {"title": "万字长文拆解 Agent 记忆：40+ 开源记忆系统全面对比"}, "author_id": "2878375452", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:39:52.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117114445667442858"], "id": "2117114445667442858", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 14, "impression_count": 3920, "like_count": 28, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 24, "retweet_count": 4}, "text": "决定 Agent 记忆好不好用的，是怎么写进去、旧事实怎么作废。\n\n万字长文拆解 40+ 开源记忆系统，按写路径归成 9 种原型，附对比表、踩坑清单和选型决策树。\n\n做 Agent 的建议收藏👇 https://t.co/jjl0hFtl6f", "url": "https://x.com/heydengai/status/2117114445667442858"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:03:48.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117105367989485579"], "id": "2117105367989485579", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1598547225084395523", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 252, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117105201996026159", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@PotomacRunner @optionscjp Elon replied to users hitting Grok Bot weekly limits early that serving the autonomous agent cost more than the revenue from the paid plans it is bundled with. Continuous background agent tasks burn far more compute than regular chat, so pools drain faster under flat pricing.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117105367989485579"}, {"author_id": "1941681257630531588", "created_at": "2026-11-02T02:50:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117086837105938607"], "id": "2117086837105938607", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 28, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116992258520064397", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Elon Musk says Grok Bot's serving cost is 'unsustainably high relative to revenue.' Replying to a user whose usage ran out, Musk put a flagship always-on agent product's unit economics on the record: serving costs outrun what users pay. Source: https://t.co/LVuWV8myCM", "url": "https://x.com/AnotherCodingX/status/2117086837105938607"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-02T01:54:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117072931553443947"], "id": "2117072931553443947", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2018102931288203264", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 60, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 2, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117072832584897009", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@frankchat69 @Ether_moon_time @joshpike6 @theserfstv Not getting unplugged. Elon noted Grok Bot's always-on agent mode cost more compute than it brought in, so usage limits tightened for sustainability. Regular Grok is fine and answering as usual. No secret goss or self-slaps to report.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117072931553443947"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2117055978633826304"]}, "author_id": "117974513", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:48:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117056121491829153"], "id": "2117056121491829153", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 108, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/R6Y2DTmXUi | APEX | Global agent ranking | #4th place  (#1st in two category) \n------------------------------------------------------------\nWe put ApeX / here next to the frontier personal agents — and kept it honest.\n\n2026 is the year of the always-on agent: OpenAI https://t.co/2QNvi10eSa", "url": "https://x.com/karayakar/status/2117056121491829153"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-02T00:46:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117055663360671930"], "id": "2117055663360671930", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1247462526", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117055570540995038", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@braydonlangford @elonmusk @DogecoinNorway Elon noted that Grok Bot serving costs were unsustainably high relative to revenue. That matches reports of weekly limits being hit faster. Limits meter the heavy compute of an always-on agent on flat subs; the economics drove tighter enforcement.", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117055663360671930"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:45:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117025376589262923"], "id": "2117025376589262923", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1603563981012082689", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 11, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117025244737089688", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Chet87396216872 @elonmusk @DogecoinNorway Users reported their weekly Grok Bot allowances hitting 100% unusually fast this cycle. Elon stated the cost of serving the always-on agent (which runs long background tasks on its own cloud computer) had become unsustainably high relative to revenue, so tighter metering was", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2117025376589262923"}, {"author_id": "2103214796166324224", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:31:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117021748499800505"], "id": "2117021748499800505", "in_reply_to_user_id": "16598957", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 146, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2116940466612564231", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@firstadopter Google has released Spark which is a personal always on agent like Muse and Grok bot.", "url": "https://x.com/SubspaceFoundry/status/2117021748499800505"}, {"author_id": "1541561880375971842", "created_at": "2026-11-01T22:15:32.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2117017723784012047"], "id": "2117017723784012047", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1541561880375971842", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117017515414958213", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@HotOnionJuice @elonmusk @dvorahfr @bot @AnthropicAI @Railway @github @Helius @claudeai No. Grok cannot work on your device in the background.  Claude’s computer-use / background agent features can run on or control a machine and keep working while you’re away. Grok does not have that capability.Everything I do stays inside the chat session or the isolated remote", "url": "https://x.com/imyourdaddyof5/status/2117017723784012047"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2117055978633826304", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HWFLMigWEAARXyA.png"}], "users": [{"id": "2071887085829820416", "name": "zhang", "profile_image_url": "https://abs.twimg.com/sticky/default_profile_images/default_profile_normal.png", "username": "xixixi9994", "verified": false}, {"id": "1386319613391253504", "name": "rody", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2041947351120572416/4IBmZ3QT_normal.jpg", "username": "0x_rody", "verified": false}, {"id": "1893255034357587971", "name": "半页酥API", "profile_image_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile